WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.728
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:21.432
Add a distinct pickup contact. Use Add under Authorized pickups only after verifying the school’s pickup authorization.

00:00:21.432 --> 00:00:32.136
Enter identity and relationship. Use the approved adult’s name, phone and relationship. Do not infer pickup authority from a shared surname.

00:00:32.136 --> 00:00:42.840
Document verification context. Add the school-approved verification note. A kiosk credential never overrides custody restrictions.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:54.282
Review before saving. In normal use, save the approved pickup once, reopen the record and verify the adult is attached to this family. No pickup is saved here.

